comment_text:
@hanny​ karena masalahnya bukan karena maudy secara eksplisit merendahkan atau menyuruh orang buat gak peduli. justru poin kritiknya lain. sebuah statement gak harus ‘menghina’ seseorang dulu baru bisa dikritik.

mindfulness/stoicism might genuinely work for her, and there’s nothing wrong with taking a break from consuming bad news. but that advice doesn’t exist in a social vacuum and my concern is that maudy is a public figure. without acknowledging that gap, an audience, especially people who aren’t politically/socially aware yet can interpret it as ‘don’t engage with what’s happening around you,’ and gradually become detached from reality.. 

it’s about questioning whether this kind of framing is appropriate when you’re speaking to such a large and diverse audience, especially in the middle of an ongoing social crisis
